libasm text-mode 上下文/节字段初始化修复（上游 bug，适配时发现并修复）。

上游 libasm 只在 binary 路径（prepare_binary_output / binary_newscn）初始化
AsmCtx 与 AsmScn 的字段；text 输出路径（prepare_text_output / text_newscn）
不初始化。但 asm_end -> __libasm_finictx -> free_section 无条件遍历/释放
content/subnext/symbol_tab 等字段 —— text 模式（textp=true，无需内部
libebl，是 libasm 可独立消费的公共 API）下这些字段是 malloc 垃圾值，
asm_end 必崩（实测 SIGTRAP/Segfault）。修复让 text 路径与 binary 路径
做同样的初始化。

上游测试（tests/asm-tst*.c）只跑 binary 模式（用 ebl_openbackend_machine），
未覆盖 text 模式，故上游从未触发此崩溃。

--- a/libasm/asm_begin.c
+++ b/libasm/asm_begin.c
@@ -45,6 +45,18 @@
 static AsmCtx_t *
 prepare_text_output (AsmCtx_t *result)
 {
+  /* Initialize the context the same way prepare_binary_output does.
+     Upstream only initialized these in the binary path; asm_end ->
+     __libasm_finictx frees them unconditionally, so a text-mode context
+     crashed on asm_end (SIGTRAP/segfault) with uninitialized fields.  */
+  result->section_list = NULL;
+  asm_symbol_tab_init (&result->symbol_tab, 67);
+  result->nsymbol_tab = 0;
+  result->section_strtab = dwelf_strtab_init (true);
+  result->symbol_strtab = dwelf_strtab_init (true);
+  result->groups = NULL;
+  result->ngroups = 0;
+
   if (result->fd == -1)
     result->out.file = stdout;
   else
--- a/libasm/asm_newscn.c
+++ b/libasm/asm_newscn.c
@@ -67,6 +67,16 @@
 static AsmScn_t *
 text_newscn (AsmScn_t *result, GElf_Word type, GElf_Xword flags)
 {
+  /* Initialize per-section fields exactly like binary_newscn does:
+     asm_end -> __libasm_finictx -> free_section walks content/subnext,
+     which must not be uninitialized garbage in text mode.  */
+  result->subsection_id = 0;
+  result->offset = 0;
+  result->max_align = 1;
+  result->content = NULL;
+  result->pattern = (struct FillPattern *) __libasm_default_pattern;
+  result->subnext = NULL;
+
   /* Buffer where we construct the flag string.  */
   char flagstr[sizeof (GElf_Xword) * 8 + 5];
   char *wp = flagstr;
